 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 509683,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Express the following number in expanded form: 45,209.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Because there are five digits in 45,209, <i>n</i> is 5. So, start with the first digit (4) times 10 raised to <i>n</i> – 1, which is the fourth power.</p>\n<p>Add the next digit times 10 raised to one less than the previous power.</p>\n<p>Continue until you end with the last digit times 10<sup>0</sup>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4 \\times {10^3} + 5 \\times {10^3} + 2 \\times {10^2} + 0 \\times {10^1} + 9 \\times {10^0}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"4 \\times {10^4} + 5 \\times {10^3} + 2 \\times {10^2} + 0 \\times {10^1} + 9 \\times {10^0}\">4 \\times {10^4} + 5 \\times {10^3} + 2 \\times {10^2} + 0 \\times {10^1} + 9 \\times {10^0}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
